# Production build overrides. Committed on purpose: nothing here is secret, and
# the point is that it applies to every release build on every machine.
#
# Vite merges .env then .env.production, with this file winning. So mocked
# billing cannot reach a release no matter what a developer left in their local
# .env — which is worth pinning here, because the failure is silent and
# expensive: the paywall would hand out the paid unlock for free after a
# convincing 1.4 second fake purchase.
#
# Remove this line when real Play Billing lands and the mock is gone.
VITE_MOCK_PURCHASE=0
